<title>USA: US bank borrowings avg $32 mln/day Jan 22 week.</title>
<headline>US bank borrowings avg $32 mln/day Jan 22 week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve said U.S. bank discount window borrowings, less extended credits, averaged $32 million per day in the week ended January 22.</p>
<p>Extended credits were nil.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660</p>
</text>
